#: plogins-withdraw.php:55
msgid "Plogins Withdraw requires WooCommerce to be installed and active."
msgstr "Für Plogins Withdraw muss WooCommerce installiert und aktiviert sein."

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: plogins-withdraw.php
msgid "https://wppoland.com"
msgstr "https://wppoland.com"

#. Author of the plugin
#: plogins-withdraw.php
msgid "WPPoland"
msgstr "WPPoland"

#. Description of the plugin
#: plogins-withdraw.php
msgid "EU right-of-withdrawal button and form (Directive 2023/2673, Art. 11a): let customers submit full or partial withdrawal requests for their orders, with an admin log and email notifications."
msgstr "Widerrufsbutton und Widerrufsformular nach EU-Recht (Richtlinie 2023/2673, Art. 11a): Kundinnen und Kunden können vollständige oder teilweise Widerrufsanträge für ihre Bestellungen einreichen, mit Admin-Protokoll und E-Mail-Benachrichtigungen."

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: plogins-withdraw.php
msgid "https://plogins.com/plogins-withdraw/"
msgstr "https://plogins.com/de/plogins-withdraw/"

